[{:db/id "q-337053/selection/5ddcfdb3dba58a510b236149e3412a43830e500627763233928741734e813f6d" :answer/id #uuid "39b72d30-e7cf-5ab0-ba97-f46b58b03b46" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+q=\\frac{3}{50}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337053/selection/c59519c5ff99f10b3649bc3d249d24c1c46ff1b7b290f26e27d86698139e13a9" :answer/id #uuid "138d6c45-c5b2-5eca-b48d-8d55aa453a73" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+\\frac{1}{250}q=30" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337053/selection/c04082315043aa33c86cc5aa869e0129e1fd7d95f472cc352f333b8fe9a592fa" :answer/id #uuid "1689a192-1421-5dc9-8fad-6dbd8ba3a3b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+q=30" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337053/selection/0fcad5121410c2c8f9cdc7f686ab44829da2a47dc245b6ab02669e349ca775f8" :answer/id #uuid "934f5940-e60b-561b-8964-5af58f2a31cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+\\frac{3}{50}q=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337053/selection/5075e8ecfa1c7c18c79f2b04a9f600dcb3cd9133061e5e5b1605b3407976eec6" :answer/id #uuid "946cce7b-4cb1-5612-ab15-6c9908885d34" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+250q=\\frac{3}{50}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337053/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "101f41db-32bc-565e-96b7-68d7c7b5df47" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-337053/selection/5ddcfdb3dba58a510b236149e3412a43830e500627763233928741734e813f6d" :answer-field/choices ["q-337053/selection/5ddcfdb3dba58a510b236149e3412a43830e500627763233928741734e813f6d" "q-337053/selection/c59519c5ff99f10b3649bc3d249d24c1c46ff1b7b290f26e27d86698139e13a9" "q-337053/selection/c04082315043aa33c86cc5aa869e0129e1fd7d95f472cc352f333b8fe9a592fa" "q-337053/selection/0fcad5121410c2c8f9cdc7f686ab44829da2a47dc245b6ab02669e349ca775f8" "q-337053/selection/5075e8ecfa1c7c18c79f2b04a9f600dcb3cd9133061e5e5b1605b3407976eec6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-337053" :question/id #uuid "be319b2e-b723-5164-af9f-5256928dd09d" :question/math-academy-id "q-337053" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14049072/assets/2cccb2a1edfeed0a562303053395c6599e14cbf08f9dc5e7f07a4d657755b1ae.png)\n\nFind the differential equation governing the amount of charge $q$ (in coulombs) on the capacitor at time $t$ (in seconds) in the circuit given in the diagram above.\n\n*Hint: The voltage drop ${V}_{C}$ across the capacitor is related to its charge by $q=C{V}_{C},$ where $C$ is the capacitance measured in Farads.*" :question/worked-solution "The diagram shows a series RC circuit with a source electromotive force (EMF) of $15\\,\\text{V},$ a resistor of resistance $250\\,Ω,$ and a capacitor of capacitance $0.004\\,\\text{F}.$\n\nThe current $I,$ measured in amperes, is defined as the rate of flow of charge $q,$ measured in coulombs. \n\n$$\nI=\\frac{\\text{d}q}{\\text{d}t}\n$$\n\nKirchhoff's voltage law states that in a series circuit, the source voltage (EMF) equals the sum of the voltage drops.\n\nIn an RC circuit, there are two voltage drops:\n\n- The voltage drop across the resistor is proportional to the current, with a constant of proportionality $R=250\\,Ω.$ So,\n\n$$\n{V}_{R}=250I=250\\,\\frac{dq}{dt}.\n$$\n\n- The voltage drop across the capacitor is related to its charge by $q=C{V}_{C}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{V}_{C}=\\frac{q}{0.004}=250q.\n$$\n\nTherefore, by Kirchhoff's voltage law, the differential equation governing the amount of charge $q$ on the capacitor is\n\n$$\n15=250\\,\\frac{dq}{dt}+250q,\n$$\n\nwhich gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{dq}{dt}+q=\\frac{3}{50}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-337053/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c51535d3-6b6a-5df3-a41f-9bad8e2edfbe"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-337053"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-337062/selection/eab593346560d0914db4ceadda94effde3f4bbea7854b6302791ff62c6e9a4aa" :answer/id #uuid "500fe9f4-0386-59e5-91ac-cb8806505de6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+10q=\\frac{6}{25}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337062/selection/82cb4d0ed0eee2df0807ed5effa5e161bbced003ddf876bb2f11eae9471f5ee3" :answer/id #uuid "d685ff90-df84-5f7d-b7ef-62ea3ef48b16" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+10q=12\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337062/selection/403db7546a3d45702aa48f0f1cd90efbadd9e9b43501bb7a31145741d5cd4e5b" :answer/id #uuid "3e261c7b-65a7-5e55-91c8-c88fcdb10df8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+500q=\\frac{6}{25}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337062/selection/37709a89ae6b95c7bb4dee79b4f9387c13c52de3451db6ad9c50509e0ef27b04" :answer/id #uuid "a02e2688-6f39-5513-840b-eebe955e7576" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+50q=\\frac{1}{12}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337062/selection/5ee91b9ba3f9a8a60e176dbe58678592c5750f058395d81dc0aea2a509939ebe" :answer/id #uuid "1fcc9b4e-8142-5d8b-a4dd-02e0fd26f4eb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+500q=12\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337062/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "15c864bf-cfbe-52d0-8d7b-7dcbf9217425" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-337062/selection/eab593346560d0914db4ceadda94effde3f4bbea7854b6302791ff62c6e9a4aa" :answer-field/choices ["q-337062/selection/eab593346560d0914db4ceadda94effde3f4bbea7854b6302791ff62c6e9a4aa" "q-337062/selection/82cb4d0ed0eee2df0807ed5effa5e161bbced003ddf876bb2f11eae9471f5ee3" "q-337062/selection/403db7546a3d45702aa48f0f1cd90efbadd9e9b43501bb7a31145741d5cd4e5b" "q-337062/selection/37709a89ae6b95c7bb4dee79b4f9387c13c52de3451db6ad9c50509e0ef27b04" "q-337062/selection/5ee91b9ba3f9a8a60e176dbe58678592c5750f058395d81dc0aea2a509939ebe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-337062" :question/id #uuid "5cf6de37-864a-51b9-9bef-fcb14b769367" :question/math-academy-id "q-337062" :question/problem "A series RC circuit has a source electromotive force (EMF) of $12\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)\\,\\text{V},$ a resistance of $50\\,Ω,$ and a capacitance of $0.002\\,\\text{F}.$ Find the differential equation governing the amount of charge $q$ (in coulombs) on the capacitor at time $t$ (in seconds).\n\n*Hint: The voltage drop ${V}_{C}$ across the capacitor is related to its charge by $q=C{V}_{C},$ where $C$ is the capacitance measured in Farads.*" :question/worked-solution "The current $I,$ measured in amperes, is defined as the rate of flow of charge $q,$ measured in coulombs. \n\n$$\nI=\\frac{\\text{d}q}{\\text{d}t}\n$$\n\nKirchhoff's voltage law states that in a series circuit, the source voltage (EMF) equals the sum of the voltage drops.\n\nIn an RC circuit, there are two voltage drops:\n\n- The voltage drop across the resistor is proportional to the current, with a constant of proportionality $R=50\\,Ω.$ So,\n\n$$\n{V}_{R}=50I=50\\,\\frac{dq}{dt}.\n$$\n\n- The voltage drop across the capacitor is related to its charge by $q=C{V}_{C}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{V}_{C}=\\frac{q}{0.002}=500q.\n$$\n\nTherefore, by Kirchhoff's voltage law, the differential equation governing the amount of charge $q$ on the capacitor is\n\n$$\n12\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)=50\\,\\frac{dq}{dt}+500q,\n$$\n\nwhich gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{dq}{dt}+10q=\\frac{6}{25}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-337062/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c51535d3-6b6a-5df3-a41f-9bad8e2edfbe"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-337062"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-337063/selection/9cf8783f9a5b84f2bd75fd51ed3bf7a264201b053422ff864957ecc6e0b04274" :answer/id #uuid "9fc3c662-e47d-5d56-8b57-f4b7a1b3ba7c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+800q=\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337063/selection/55a79ab90c90d67587a0f338aa86696da1ac7432e0077378898c28944d53abd2" :answer/id #uuid "e40203fc-ec03-58d5-bc5b-78a7d2941a51" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+80q=\\frac{1}{16}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337063/selection/1339d9b3900b3c984a951dc4ecd57690f08aed166466c09b3f2d0b8f98e8a5ae" :answer/id #uuid "7b31e68a-e510-578a-888c-86734cf60cd4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+10q=\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337063/selection/fba7f6a94b60ac1fff57a58643e61b450a9ead7a81bfbfc35e9b4f6e66e944e7" :answer/id #uuid "2c25ee68-50a3-5079-99e0-3caee8b280cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+10q=16\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337063/selection/9ecfe10c51a4df781364d1d595e05464c25e4eb9dfc3497886ba3d457ebfc5f7" :answer/id #uuid "36a8d11b-8f36-58df-a06f-52d1a72fad33" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dq}{dt}+800q=16\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-337063/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ea64a2c8-97bc-50a3-befc-770653526291" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-337063/selection/1339d9b3900b3c984a951dc4ecd57690f08aed166466c09b3f2d0b8f98e8a5ae" :answer-field/choices ["q-337063/selection/9cf8783f9a5b84f2bd75fd51ed3bf7a264201b053422ff864957ecc6e0b04274" "q-337063/selection/55a79ab90c90d67587a0f338aa86696da1ac7432e0077378898c28944d53abd2" "q-337063/selection/1339d9b3900b3c984a951dc4ecd57690f08aed166466c09b3f2d0b8f98e8a5ae" "q-337063/selection/fba7f6a94b60ac1fff57a58643e61b450a9ead7a81bfbfc35e9b4f6e66e944e7" "q-337063/selection/9ecfe10c51a4df781364d1d595e05464c25e4eb9dfc3497886ba3d457ebfc5f7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-337063" :question/id #uuid "fec00bec-d7d0-523c-a284-99e9cf18db59" :question/math-academy-id "q-337063" :question/problem "A series RC circuit has a source electromotive force (EMF) of $16\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)\\,\\text{V},$ a resistance of $80\\,Ω,$ and a capacitance of $0.00125\\,\\text{F}.$ Find the differential equation governing the amount of charge $q$ (in coulombs) on the capacitor at time $t$ (in seconds).\n\n*Hint: The voltage drop ${V}_{C}$ across the capacitor is related to its charge by $q=C{V}_{C},$ where $C$ is the capacitance measured in Farads.*" :question/worked-solution "The current $I,$ measured in amperes, is defined as the rate of flow of charge $q,$ measured in coulombs. \n\n$$\nI=\\frac{\\text{d}q}{\\text{d}t}\n$$\n\nKirchhoff's voltage law states that in a series circuit, the source voltage (EMF) equals the sum of the voltage drops.\n\nIn an RC circuit, there are two voltage drops:\n\n- The voltage drop across the resistor is proportional to the current, with a constant of proportionality $R=80\\,Ω.$ So,\n\n$$\n{V}_{R}=80I=80\\,\\frac{dq}{dt}.\n$$\n\n- The voltage drop across the capacitor is related to its charge by $q=C{V}_{C}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{V}_{C}=\\frac{q}{0.00125}=800q.\n$$\n\nTherefore, by Kirchhoff's voltage law, the differential equation governing the amount of charge $q$ on the capacitor is\n\n$$\n16\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)=80\\,\\frac{dq}{dt}+800q,\n$$\n\nwhich gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{dq}{dt}+10q=\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-337063/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c51535d3-6b6a-5df3-a41f-9bad8e2edfbe"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-337063"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-337039/selection/751ce76d81e6